OL,3,GNEWSABBC to cut 58 jobs in Wales as
OL,4,Apart of savings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Wales will lose a total of 58 jobs
OL,7,Fin its latest round of cuts, BBC Wales'
OL,8,Finterim director has said.
OL,10,FIt is understood this will affect a
OL,11,Flarger number of its 680 staff members,
OL,12,Fincluding those in part-time or shared
OL,13,Fpositions.
OL,15,FAs part of the cost-saving measures, 20
OL,16,Fhours of television programming will no
OL,17,Flonger be produced and several radio
OL,18,Fprogrammes have also been dropped.
OL,20,FThe changes across the department are
OL,21,Fpart of the corporation's wider #500m
OL,22,Fsavings plan.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
